3. Install package manager.
4. Upload project or connect GitHub.
5. Install dependencies.
6. Build project.
7. Configure environment variables.
8. Configure database.
9. Run migrations.
10. Start app with process manager.
11. Configure reverse proxy.
12. Connect domain.
13. Enable SSL.
14. Test production flows.

Do not go too deep into VPS commands unless the project needs it.
